WEBVTT

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.550
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.180
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed, do they want to protect themselves or other people.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.740
Or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.650
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.340
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:19.470
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.700
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:43.530
Wonderful, just as I thought! I’m glad I bought it though it was a bit expensive.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.800
I guess I have to resist buying for a while.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:53.880
Next door

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.850
Yuurisan-Subs & マイワイフ Subs

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.850
http://yuurisan-subs.org
http://maiwaifufansubs.wordpress.com

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.850
Sub Dedicated to Enma Ai

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:28.420
This program is made possible by Sony Music,

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:33.940
and the listed sponsors.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:42.250
Die!

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.840
Wait, dog!

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.520
Hime! Please wait, Hime!

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:52.500
A Chiwawa?

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:58.420
Momo

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.620
Hand it over!

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:03.850
Don’t be mean to her.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:07.890
It’s for a feast! It tastes better
when you let it swim for a while!

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:10.880
Are you going to eat her, Hime?

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:14.250
No…

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:16.700
Quick! Run away!

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:18.110
Hurry!

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:19.110
Yes!

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:20.720
Get out of my way, Yamawaro!

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:21.560
No you can’t!

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:24.510
Get out of my way, it’s our dinner!

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:28.220
Thank you so much!

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.670
It’s no big deal; I just found her by chance.

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:36.030
Shame! She ran away suddenly during our walk.

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:38.270
You brought her all the way back!

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:39.970
I was close, so…

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:42.360
Say thanks to the nice girl!

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:45.320
Hello, Hatsumi-san.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.730
Hello.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:50.010
Oh, Shintani-san, your bracelet is wonderful!

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:52.000
Oh this? This I…

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.740
You match Momo!

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:56.000
What do you mean, Momo?

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:59.000
See? I bought it for myself,

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.020
but it was too big, so I made it her collar!

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:06.300
I guess it’s a dog tag now!

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.900
Oh.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:12.390
Maybe I should have given it to you and not Momo?

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.980
Right, Momo?

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.020
Yuzuki-chan,

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.960
would you like to come over for tea as a token of my gratitude?

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:22.840
I just got some cookies I wanted!

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:23.740
But…

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:28.100
Momo says she wants to play more! Right?

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:29.820
Then, maybe a short while.

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:32.640
Well, Shintani-san, excuse us.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:41.730
Shintani-san, are you off somewhere? Always looking fine!

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:44.400
What happened? Your face’s color…

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:50.740
Caretaker, aren’t pets prohibited? We’ll
be in trouble if you don’t caution them!

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:52.790
Hatsumi

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:58.740
Looks like Momo’s used to you already!
Yuzuki-chan, do you like dogs?

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:01.120
Yes, but I can’t keep one at home.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:07.080
Oh, are pets not allowed? It’s fine if
you’re quiet, they usually don’t realize.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.900
Oh, no, it’s because I’m living alone.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:10.770
Oh, really?

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:15.010
Right, since pedigreed dogs are expensive.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:16.530
Right, Momo?

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.270
Then, would you like to come over to see Momo again tomorrow?

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:24.250
It’s Sunday, so let’s have tea together at 3!

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:26.960
S-Sure.

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:44.800
Hey wait!

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:46.330
Wait for m-

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:50.830
Are you OK? You made some weird noise.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:52.800
What? No, I’m fine.

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:55.590
Those shoes!

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:56.540
What?

00:05:56.540 --> 00:06:00.600
It’s from last year’s series of an
Italian brand, right?

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:02.740
Wow, good eyes.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:05.330
I went to Italy last week with my mom.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:08.820
They go on sale after their season ends.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.890
I was wondering whether to buy those.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:13.820
Really?

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:16.340
But there was one that wasn’t announced in Japan yet,

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:19.860
so I bought that one; isn’t wasting money bad?

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:23.670
Shintani-san, you’re good at buying things, aren’t you?

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:30.000
Not at all! I almost reached my card’s limit last month!

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:33.990
What? How do you know when you reach your maximum?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:34.970
What?

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:38.130
I don’t know how much I use my card!

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:38.910
What?!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.440
Mioi-san, um…

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.680
Eww, it peed!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:43.870
Hey, wait!

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:46.760
Too bad, Momo-chan.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:50.490
I’m sorry Shintani-san, can you hold the
elevator for a moment please?

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:51.050
What?

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:54.880
I’m leaving Momo with you; I’ll fetch a towel quickly!

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:02.500
Uh, I’ll hold the elevator, so…

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:04.380
Really! I’ll leave it to you, then.

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:11.400
Momo-chan, shame!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:16.410
Caution her properly! What? How could this happen?

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:24.200
Really, she was holding it! Sorry I didn’t notice!

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:27.800
Let’s clean your clothes off!

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.450
Is this dog urine?

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.850
How troublesome!

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:47.590
Oh, Caretaker! I saw Hatsumi-san’s dog do that.

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:51.100
Oh, Hatsumi-san’s dog?

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:58.470
Hatsumi-san!

00:07:58.470 --> 00:07:59.570
Yes?

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:02.750
As an owner, please clean after your dog.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:03.570
What?

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:05.850
I’ll be troubled if you don’t have good manners!

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:08.090
Yes.

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:16.090
Momo-chan, be patient! I’ll be home soon.

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:49.980
Oh, a Chiwawa!

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:51.940
How cute!

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:57.950
Chiwawas are popular! But what’s with
putting clothes on them?

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:01.460
I think it might be OK; it’s cute.

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.540
Not cute, I mean…

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:04.480
Kind of…

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:06.960
A silly face!

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:07.480
Hmm?

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:23.920
Let’s go out! Are you going out, too?

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.120
Yes, a bit.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:31.990
Hey, Hatsumi-san, apparently there’s a
rude dog in this condo right now.

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:36.990
Really! Peeing in the stairwell and
barking in the hallways at night.

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.810
I wonder whose dog it is?

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:43.430
Momo’ll be in trouble if they don’t improve.

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:50.290
But they’re pretty idiotic pranks, so it might just be children.

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:53.580
Shintani-san?

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:54.840
Shintani-san?

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:02.570
I wonder what happened?
Shintani-san so weird, right?

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:06.040
Who does she think she is? It’s a bit much!

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:16.910
You… let’s fight!

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:27.430
Hatsumi-sama,

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:27.430
please clean 
your veranda.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:34.950
Yes?

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:38.420
Welcome, Yuzuki-chan!

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:42.060
Hello, this was on your door.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.640
I wonder what it is?

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:46.260
Hatsumi-sama,

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:46.260
please clean 
your veranda.

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.260
The veranda?

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:50.540
What is this? It stinks!

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.090
Why is there kitchen garbage?

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:54.360
Shintani-san!

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:56.520
Shintani-san?

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.580
What? Why did this happen?

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:06.980
What? What is this?

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:17.830
Stop this!

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:18.380
Mioi-san!

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:21.780
It hurts!

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:36.480
What? She said that?

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:40.060
Yes, even though she has a cute face and doesn’t look like she would hurt a fly,

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:42.100
she says quite mean things!

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:45.780
So maybe they like <i>those</i>  things, too?

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:48.890
So I guess they’re switching?

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:49.730
Really?

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:53.790
It’s Hatsumi-san!

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.780
Oh, good morning!

00:11:57.280 --> 00:12:00.070
Oh, good morning!

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.750
What a deplorable demeanor!

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:04.000
With such a cute face!

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:15.250
Correct!

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:17.310
Horray!

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:20.220
You want to be especially careful with meals.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:25.010
Some dogs’ lives depends on it, so be cautious.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:28.550
Which foods specifically should we be careful with?

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.950
There are many, but for dogs…

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:38.440
Momo, don’t go ahead! Wait!

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:46.340
Here you go! Eat this delicious meat!

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:49.430
Here, come here!

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:55.680
Momo! Momo! Momo?

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:57.290
Momo-chan?

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:00.610
Momo-chan!

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:03.760
Momo! Momo, what happened? Momo!

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:07.520
What’s this ruckus?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:14.190
Hatsumi-san, what’re you doing in the hall? You’re bothering everyone!

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:17.940
Oh, what happened to your dog? All limp…

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:23.820
Maybe she’s ill? You should take her to the hospital soon.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:30.260
Take care of your pets, or you’ll bother everybody!

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:36.180
Shintani-san!

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:39.280
Shintani-san! It was you, wasn’t it?

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:42.690
Garbage on the veranda, kicking walls… 
That was you wasn’t it?

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:46.050
Why, why are you doing this?

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:51.720
Why? Why? Weren’t we friends?

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:56.730
Have I done something wrong? Tell me!

00:13:56.730 --> 00:14:00.270
Doing something so bad without saying anything!

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:02.940
I’m sad! Shintani-san, you’re dirty!

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:08.330
Momo…

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:12.760
I won’t forgive you!

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:27.130
Stay healthy!

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:40.620
Wait! Leave that dog! Hand it over!

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:44.850
What are you going to do? Wanna ferry her?

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:46.930
Wanna call Jigoku Shoujo?

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:51.660
Jigoku Shoujo…

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:14.900
Momo, does it hurt? Wait, mom will take revenge for you.

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:15.210
Shintani

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:17.360
Send

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:15.410
Shintani

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.410
Shintani

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:16.310
Michiru

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:16.510
Michiru

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:17.410
Michiru

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:17.410
Send

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.860
Send

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:26.850
I’m here.

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:34.840
Jigoku… Shoujo… Momo!

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.450
Ichimoku Ren.

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:40.180
OK, Ojou.

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:46.390
Take this.

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:55.320
If you really want to take revenge, pull the red string.

00:15:57.050 --> 00:16:02.120
If you pull it, it would signify signing a formal contract with me.

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:05.330
The one you curse will swiftly be sent to Hell.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:11.060
But if you do, you must pay the price.

00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:18.810
Curse someone, and two holes are created.
Agree, and your soul falls to Hell, too.

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:20.380
Hell?

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:23.840
Well, that’s after you die.

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:32.310
The rest is up to you.

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:42.430
Mioi-san…

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:53.400
Momo, let’s go to the doctor.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:57.980
Away?

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:00.610
Weird, I was in my room the whole time.

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:04.240
They left it with Shintani-san!

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.940
Good job realizing I was up here.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.830
That’s Momo’s things!

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:20.860
Oh, this?

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:22.830
Please return them!

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:24.850
Return what?

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:26.840
The toilet sheets!

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:29.830
What? I can’t hear you!

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:33.340
Toilet sheets! Toilet sheets!

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:36.600
Oh, you want these that much?

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:42.030
It’s not whether I want it or not, it came to us! Why do you have it?

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:44.930
You don’t need it anymore, right, since your dog died?

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:47.010
Momo’s not dead!

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:52.060
I heard some food was poisonous for dogs, on TV.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.990
I mixed it in to make a special meal… What a failure!

00:17:56.790 --> 00:18:00.450
That’s horrible! Do you know how much Momo is suffering?

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:06.900
Although you don’t know about people’s
feelings, you know about a dog’s?

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:08.170
What?

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:12.600
So, put these away.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.450
Get ’em!

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:22.170
Hurry up, or they’ll fly away!

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:33.220
Horrible… horrible!

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:38.510
There’s some over there! And come quickly over here!

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:51.580
Looks like you can’t get it! Try hopping the barrier.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.810
You can’t even do that? You’re less than a dog!

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:10.740
What? What is this?

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:24.530
Someone, someone save me!

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:31.230
Momo! You came for me, Momo!

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:35.570
Momo! Momo! Momo! Here I go! Momo!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:51.560
Your curse is received.

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:49.840
What? Where am I?

00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:54.010
W-What is this?

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:58.790
The deadly garbage bag bomber!

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:08.750
What? Who are you?

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:10.690
Water from a tank!

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:11.710
Attack!

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:38.030
Says she, Ojou.

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:43.500
O pitiful shadow, wandering in darkness.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:46.270
Scarring people and degrading them.

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:48.570
The ball of karma drowned in sin.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:52.800
Do you want to die this once?

00:22:00.020 --> 00:22:01.650
Super effective absorbancy.

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:10.700
She stinks!

00:22:13.090 --> 00:22:17.060
This curse will ferry you to Hell.

00:22:24.170 --> 00:22:25.640
Hatsumi Mioi

00:22:24.600 --> 00:22:25.670
Listen,

00:22:25.700 --> 00:22:31.150
Yuzuki-chan, they say that dogs aren’t allowed in these rooms.

00:22:31.180 --> 00:22:32.640
How sad!

00:22:32.670 --> 00:22:34.150
I agree.

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:40.870
I wonder how Momo-chan’s doing right now? She’s probably so lonely!

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:42.160
Momo…

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:49.740
I shall release your grudge.

00:22:45.240 --> 00:22:49.740
Note: Candle says, Hatsumi Mioi.

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:19.920 --> 00:24:45.940
Preview

00:24:20.620 --> 00:24:21.730
Your name?

00:24:21.760 --> 00:24:23.150
Inao Kaede.

00:24:23.180 --> 00:24:26.350
Hey, I understand your feelings, but…

00:24:26.380 --> 00:24:28.730
There’s nothing else I could do!

00:24:28.760 --> 00:24:31.720
Otherwise, it’ll all disappear.

00:24:31.750 --> 00:24:33.790
Someone looked at me!

00:24:33.820 --> 00:24:34.950
I made friends!

00:24:34.980 --> 00:24:37.820
I don’t want to be alone anymore!

00:24:37.850 --> 00:24:39.020
Because of that…

